    intro:"Go on vacation is a phrase meaning to take a holiday or trip away from home for rest or pleasure. Common phrases include go on vacation, on vacation, and a summer vacation. For example, 'We go on vacation.' It is more common in American English; in British English, 'go on holiday' is used.",
